  indirectHint: The three pages may reveal more than just symbols. Look closely at
    what they have in common.
  directHint: Combine the symbols from all three cipher pages to discover the title
    of the book. Search for that title on the bookshelf beneath the statue.
  solvedHint: The passage behind the shelf stands open. Whatever Sabrina found lies
    beyond it.
